---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro'; import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | GameCore Labs" description="Generic privacy policy template for the GameCore Labs website."><PageHero eyebrow="LEGAL" title="Privacy Policy" description="Last updated: September 10, 2026. This generic website template should be reviewed before production or legal use." compact/><section class="section-tight"><article class="container prose legal"><h2>Information We Collect</h2><p>We may collect information you choose to provide, such as your name, email address, organization and project details.</p><h2>How We Use Information</h2><p>Information is used to respond to inquiries, evaluate project fit, communicate about requested services and maintain website security.</p><h2>Contact Forms</h2><p>When a form endpoint is configured, project brief data is sent to that service. Review the endpoint provider and update this policy before enabling it.</p><h2>Cookies</h2><p>This template does not add optional tracking cookies. Hosting providers may use essential technical data to deliver and secure the site.</p><h2>Third-Party Services</h2><p>External links and a future form provider may process data under their own terms. Configure and disclose those services before production use.</p><h2>Data Retention</h2><p>Keep inquiry data only as long as reasonably necessary for communication, project planning and applicable obligations.</p><h2>Your Rights</h2><p>Depending on your location, you may request access, correction or deletion of personal information. Legal requirements vary by jurisdiction.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this template can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>.</p></article></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.legal{max-width:860px}.legal a{color:#b8c6ff;text-decoration:underline}</style>
